Feature: Account Lockout Mechanism

  Scenario Outline: Five failed sign-ins lock an account for five minutes
    Given I am a security officer
    When I attempt to sign in with the wrong password for "<username>" five times within fifteen minutes
    Then my sign-in is refused with "TOO_MANY_ATTEMPTS" even with the right password
    And other accounts are not affected

    Examples:
      | username |
      | user1    |
      | user2    |

  Scenario: Boundary case - four failed attempts do not lock account
