    When I attempt to sign in with the wrong password for "user3" four times within fifteen minutes
    Then my sign-in is refused with "WRONG_PASSWORD"
    And other accounts are not affected

  Scenario: Boundary case - six failed attempts do not lock account further
    Given I am a security officer
